      "text_preview": "According to the Public Analyst (PA) report, the level is within permissible limits, whereas the report of the Referral Food Laboratory (RFL) is silent on this aspect."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ea625eabc6f641a8aba9b99d2d15a08d_138",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
