      "text_preview": "Further, Table no. 1, containing food category system no. 1.6.4.2, with respect to flavoured processed cheese and table no. 12, containing food category system no. 12.4, with respect to the mustard, allows the use of coloring material, and "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9118f3ad53b04a6cba577949161a0b00_140",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nFINDINGS 40."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d78b4a3133d14d4fb0197e44bc70fae3_142",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Before proceeding further, it will be pertinent to refer to the relevant provisions of law involved in the present case for ready reference, which are as follows:\nSection 26 deals with Responsibilities of the food business operator - (1) Ev"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "967d4b81e13c4230a5148ac623219f9c_143",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "(2)\nNo food business operator shall himself or by any person on his behalf manufacture,\nstore, sell or distribute any article of food- (i) which is unsafe;\nCr. Case 19238-2020 FSO v. Ram Bahadur Sreshtha & Ors.. Page No. 16 of 25 1. Section"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d555d02abfcb4d86be72e1867e23ec2f_144",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Section 59 deals with Punishment for unsafe food: Any person who, whether by himself or by any other person on his behalf, manufactures for sale or stores or sells or distributes or imports any article of food for human consumption which is"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5679051630e84e2fab21c8aff54513cc_145",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": ",\nshall be punishable- (i) where such failure or contravention does not result in injury,\nwith imprisonment for a term which may extend to six months and also with fine which may extend to one lakh rupees."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a59511c3335941a98b085a25fa19a435_146",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "41. Let's begin with the first line of the defence of the accused persons who argued before the Court that the container in which the sample was stored was not clean and dry and thus, the sample proceedings were conducted in utter disregard"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "cb3fe57830bd413a972ff0b65faead85_147",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n42. Perusal of the testimony of PW-4 and PW-5, would show that the sample was cut into smallest possible pieces with the help of clean and dry knife in a clean and dry tray and properly mixed with the help of a clean and dry spoon in all p"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1a9ece282ee04e41ad5307ec7d58555e_148",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Further, nothing contradictory could be brought on record by the accused persons to show that the utensils were not clean and dry except putting suggestions."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "c287ca8b01d64e95ba4c94ede5af4011_149",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "However, those suggestions are not sufficient to doubt the Cr. Case 19238-2020 FSO v. Ram Bahadur Sreshtha & Ors.."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5e903c4ef91f4e5ebba41b77b9692469_150",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Page No. 17 of 25 proceedings conducted by the public servant and the fact that the sample proceedings were conducted as per the regulations stands proved beyond reasonable doubt.\n43."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "988b528f2a7e4bc4a0ee9756e57ec835_151",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Now, let's address the arguments put forth by the accused persons regarding the permissibility of coloring material, including synthetic colors, following the enactment of the 2016 amendment."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a8b2c3a73a9c4b43a2bd4b5211fc23f8_152",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "44. Before proceeding further, let's examine the pertinent regulation and its implications in light of the 2016 amendment."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "7300d86375fa4001a5a27a3db8bd6ed0_153",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "45. As per the 2016 Amendment, the regulation 3.1 with respect to the food additives in the Food Safety and Standards (Food Products Standards and Food Additives), Regulations 2011 were amended and regulation 3.1 was substituted."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1c026c47fdf446e4a3f307366d5223ca_154",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The Regulation 3.1 of the Regulation, amended in the year 2016, pertains to food additives and provides what food additives may be used in a food,\nwherein a food category system was made and was appended with the Regulation 3.1 as appendix "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "59a4f8586e03493f80d2a676f7bd37c3_155",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "46. Since, the case of the accused persons falls within the category of prepared food, which is regulated by Rule 16 attached to the Cr. Case 19238-2020 FSO v. Ram Bahadur Sreshtha & Ors.."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8fecbd9119d6425cbeba2bb2437bcd3b_156",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nPage No. 18 of 25 appendix A, in Regulation 3.1.1."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9b76d95a4e0f4e4e8d317feba5707615_157",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The Rule 16 provides that the foods which are not included in the remaining rules are to be considered on a case by case basis."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "43c52f1901a04375b0ab901c62944493_158",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Further, prepared foods are mixture of multiple components, the said components are included in other food categories."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0deae308f983492da91f15bc47d5c5b2_159",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nAlso, prepared foods required minimal preparation by the consumer and the provisions for additives will be listed in this food category in these regulations only if the additive is needed; (i) Solely to have a technological function in the"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "29bd7f609ffe425cb57ad28e535604c7_160",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "accounted for by carry over from the individual components."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e20b15dfc71e4a09915e4e494b75504a_161",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "47. Furthermore, the functional classes, definitions and technological purposes have been stated in the part three, wherein the definition of color is mentioned as a food additive which adds or restores color in a food and the technological"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "919ba3be33034a549c06388b0d58563d_162",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Also, color retention agent is defined as a food additive, which stabilizes,\nretains or intensifies the color of a food and the technological purpose is mentioned as color fixation/retention/stabilization."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ebcf764d13194a0baac3f68235487681_163",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "48. Further, if we read Part 1 of the Appendix A, relating to food category system, it reveals that food category system is a tool for assigning food additives uses in these regulations and the food Cr. Case 19238-2020 FSO v. Ram Bahadur Sr"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "fa683c01d3cc43d7a9997697deaa6c4d_164",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Page No. 19 of 25 category system applies to all food stuffs wherein, food category system takes into consideration the carry over principle."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5538fed9276f4beeae22d687763072cd_165",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It has been stated that the food category system does not meet to specifically mentioned compound food stuffs unless the compound food stuff needs an additive that is not endorsed for use in any of its components."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5efb6c0689d542cdb0bec8e6bd2affd6_166",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "49. In reference to the above, reliance has to be placed upon the Regulation 3.1.1.10, wherein it is mentioned that other than by direct addition, an additive may be present in a food as a result of carry over from a raw material or ingredi"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0b79b1e52e0c448a890a54e838bfb4af_167",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "50. In light of the preceding discussion, it is evident that following the enactment of the 2016 amendment, coloring materials, including synthetic colors, are permissible."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "033704f4a4d349a3ba432f794666fa99_168",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Separate tables have been appended, delineating different types of food ingredients and listing the colors that are allowed along with their permissible limits."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "22a4c77075814c3a855b8ff061503b8c_169",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nCr. Case 19238-2020 FSO v. Ram Bahadur Sreshtha & Ors.. Page No. 20 of 25 51."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f5bf9ad346ab476aa7914cbb98a4d36e_170",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Furthermore, Rule 16 pertains to prepared foods, permitting the usage of coloring material either directly added or carried forward."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d170b35da5c143c09eeb5209951bde9f_171",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, the assessment of the sampled food must be conducted on a case-by-case basis."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5cdcc93dfa224a1b9c55549a84aed0a1_172",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "While the Referral Food Laboratory (RFL) report mentioning that sunset FCF coloring material is impermissible may appear conclusive, it must be determined whether any provision has been violated in light of this report."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "311ed622418d4d0eb37ddb4b1757f9c5_173",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The report will conclusively establish the presence or absence of coloring material."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ba59d1ebda9145b5bf39df32ed913d95_174",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "However, this does not imply that the court must unquestionably accept the report; rather, it can scrutinize the validity of the alleged contravention against the accused persons."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1f1c0e763d5f4cde937fc20071a7e52e_175",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nFood Safety Officer vs Ram Bahadur Sreshtha on 21 March, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/23127509/\n10 52."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0ba3b22c39444f61ab56619ebcdde4bf_176",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Since there is no mechanism for listing the categories of prepared foods and permissible coloring material usage, it would have been an arduous task to highlight the same due to the vast food network in the country."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "3ad7aed38b284e739d00e0371d3ebef1_177",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, one must rely on the ingredients used in the preparation of food to understand whether there was any possibility of coloring material being carried forward, after analyzing the same from tables appended to the regulation."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "85bf361596db48ab89d12cb57974be79_178",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "There may be situations where the accused persons, being food proprietors, might not have knowledge of whether any ingredients used by them had any coloring material additionally added to them Cr. Case 19238-2020 FSO v. Ram Bahadur Sreshtha"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "95b5589c18b448d3993fa6068959432c_179",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Page No. 21 of 25 53."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4fd177aebd2b4ba4b0b74018a0c66ebd_180",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Additionally, apart from Form No. VA filled during the sample lifting proceedings, there is apparently no rule in the regulations, or brought to the notice of the court by either party,\nmandating the disclosure of food ingredients in a part"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1e4cba28bef84240a04fff0d94744fea_181",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In this case, the prosecution heavily relies upon the ingredients disclosed in Form No. VA."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b6f3c14680924e3b904b9faab59ddb95_182",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "However, this approach has been vehemently opposed by the defense, mentioning that no reasonable opportunity was granted to them despite pleading before the Food Safety Officer (FSO) that the entire ingredients could be disclosed by the nom"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0b44f9ff1a3749de8524e4a63d38fef9_183",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n54. To emphasize this point, the defense has posed questions regarding the failure to provide a reasonable opportunity to disclose the ingredients to the prosecution witnesses."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "aa8cf665223747c8a5a0b9bd96395be3_184",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Although categorically denied by the witnesses, the report of the Food Analyst (FA) casts doubt on the witnesses stance by mentioning that particles of onion and capsicum were notably visible."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1802879eebb745d7a4d5227879f51ed3_185",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "This leads to the conclusion that the ingredients mentioned in Form No. VA does not indicate the detailed ingredients of the prepared food in question, making the point of the accused persons more tenable and plausible."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f3b057ced6884ac5917e9270c91c3753_186",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "55. During the defense evidence, it was stated that ingredients like processed cheese and mustard were also used in the prepared food."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "eb46f3a1e3814f479c109e32a2310f61_187",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The prosecution failed to demonstrate anything contrary to highlight Cr. Case 19238-2020 FSO v. Ram Bahadur Sreshtha & Ors.."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "24ef2123d2a94d808070ce33a18759cd_188",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Page No. 22 of 25 that such ingredients could not have been used in the prepared food in question, i.e. Paneer Tikka Masala."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ceb8c4ed0ffe4bc78aed54f783bf682b_189",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nThus, the existence of ingredients as disclosed during the defense evidence must be taken note of."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0f795a49c3be4ed2a9fa4a9c8a79f008_190",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "56. Evidently, the act permits the usage of sunset yellow FC in ingredients such as processed cheese and mustard, provided it is within permissible limits."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "cec8c0fa61464e89a5abd63d07866d1d_191",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The relevant table as already discussed in the preceding paragraphs provides that the level of the coloring material i.e. sunset yellow FC in mustard and processed cheese is allowed upto 100 mg/kg."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "020358eaac9b4328af2b14a7b39c0010_192",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "57. The report of the Referral Food Laboratory (RFL) does not indicate the levels of coloring material used in the food."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f8918785b04c48949a5781feec64f934_193",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Hence, reliance must be placed upon the report of the Food Analyst (FA)\nwhere the levels have been mentioned as 15.67 ppm, and it will be found that the usage of coloring material is within permissible limits."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a36d7c09fa60407d9a2ab47a6f34b77b_194",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, no violation is found in this regard by the accused persons."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "28733930f4374b9aa3ecc7030e39e86c_195",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "58. The question regarding the complaint not being filed within one year stands amply clarified on the basis of the prosecution witnesses, wherein it has been mentioned that the time to launch the Food Safety Officer vs Ram Bahadur Sreshtha"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a18b8e93483c47bdbfb7a86e7e052a61_196",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It has also been clarified that the previous FSO has proceeded on maternity leave and the case was subsequently Cr. Case 19238-2020 FSO v. Ram Bahadur Sreshtha & Ors.."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "86c756c033fd47f5af55c558bea423fd_197",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Page No. 23 of 25 marked to another FSO."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b2e54b32af624617ae76be55bfbdeb42_198",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Also, summoning order passed by the Court was never challenged and the controversy regarding the limitation period has been put to rest on the basis of the order regarding the sanction, mentioning about the extension of the time limit U/s 7"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "914bb94bba0842248e85a1137b03b652_199",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The fact that no separate order was passed is of no consequence as there is no requirement as per the Regulation qua the same."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2626f3db46ad49358170057dd9001a1a_200",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Secondly, the sanction being undated cannot signify that the sanction was granted without the application of mind."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5df9184d49694573b99f6fea6aafa0c8_201",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It has been categorically stated by the witness that the date has been mentioned in the official noting."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "725a7701dee04739807434310c0ac6e2_202",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "This anomaly could be inadvertence on the part of the Commissioner, which should not have happened but the same cannot lead to the conclusion that no application of mind was exercised at the time of grant of the sanction."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "6e59d8d0aeac4653a200410147b3c2a9_203",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Thus, these arguments addressed on behalf of the accused are without merits."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b45cdbe496dc410cb0d4652b65192a8f_204",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "59. Therefore, in view of the aforesaid discussion, the prosecution could not establish the case beyond reasonable doubt and any doubt in the case has to go in favour of the accused persons."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "54e753877b0d4e33a75e8d3085f13284_205",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As already discussed, no grounds are made out to declare that the sample lifted was unsafe."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4db038feaef44e4ebeaa5d526784b599_206",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nAccordingly, accused persons namely Ram Bahadur Sreshtha, VR Anirudh Krishna and accused no.\n3 M/s Pind Balluchi (A Unit of JS Hospitatlity Services Pvt. Ltd) represented through its AR Sh.\nShakti Prasad stand acquitted for the offence U/s"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9d6086e0fc124c80bc6b84d47e20c02d_209",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Accused persons are directed to furnish personal bonds U/s 437A Cr.PC in the sum of Rs.10,000/- each."
    }
  ],
